          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start from the very beginning" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulai dari awal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Learning" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulai Belajar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Storm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mulai Puzzle Storm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start your chess journey. Learn how each piece moves, understand essential board rules, and grasp the absolute fundamentals of safe captures and defense." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Langkah awal perjalanan caturmu. Kenali cara jalan setiap bidak, pahami aturan dasar, dan kuasai teknik fundamental untuk bertahan serta menangkap bidak dengan aman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streak Ended" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Streak Berakhir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streak Ended!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rentetan Berakhir!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take a 15-puzzle placement test" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ikuti tes penempatan 15 teka-teki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms & Privacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketentuan & Privasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Bishop" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gajah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bishop moves any number of squares diagonally in any direction, provided the path is clear. It cannot jump over other pieces and must stay on the same square color for the entire game. To capture, the bishop moves to a square occupied by an opponent's piece and removes it from the board." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gajah bergerak diagonal ke arah manapun sejauh mungkin, asalkan jalurnya tidak terhalang. Gajah tidak dapat melompati buah lain dan harus tetap berada di warna kotak yang sama sepanjang permainan. Untuk memakan, gajah bergerak ke kotak yang ditempati oleh buah lawan dan menyingkirkannya dari papan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The correct move has been highlighted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Langkah yang benar telah disorot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The King" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Raja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king moves exactly one square in any direction: horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. It is the most important piece but has limited mobility, and it can never move onto a square that is under attack by an enemy piece." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Raja bergerak tepat satu kotak ke arah manapun: horizontal, vertikal, atau diagonal. Raja adalah buah yang paling penting namun memiliki pergerakan yang terbatas, dan tidak pernah boleh bergerak ke kotak yang sedang diserang oleh buah lawan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Knight" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kuda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knight moves in an L-shape: two squares in one direction (vertically or horizontally) and then one square perpendicularly. It is the unique piece that can jump over other pieces, and it always lands on a square of the opposite color from its starting position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kuda bergerak membentuk huruf L: dua kotak dalam satu arah (vertikal atau horizontal) dan kemudian satu kotak secara tegak lurus. Kuda adalah buah unik yang dapat melompati buah lain, dan selalu mendarat di kotak dengan warna yang berlawanan dari posisi awalnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Pawn" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn moves directly forward one square at a time, but on its first move, it can advance two squares if both are vacant. It captures by moving one square diagonally forward to the left or right, and it is the only piece that captures differently than it moves. If a pawn reaches the opposite end of the board, it is promoted to any piece except a king, and it can also perform the special en passant capture." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pion bergerak lurus ke depan satu kotak demi satu kotak, tetapi pada langkah pertamanya, pion dapat maju dua kotak jika keduanya kosong. Pion memakan buah lawan dengan bergerak satu kotak secara diagonal ke depan kiri atau kanan, dan merupakan satu-satunya buah yang cara memakannya berbeda dari cara bergeraknya. Jika pion mencapai ujung papan lawan, pion tersebut akan dipromosikan menjadi buah apa saja selain raja, dan pion juga dapat melakukan gerakan menangkap khusus yang disebut en passant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Queen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menteri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queen is the most powerful piece in chess, able to move any number of squares horizontally, vertically, or diagonally in a straight line. It combines the movement powers of the rook and the bishop but cannot jump over other pieces. The queen captures an opponent's piece by landing on the square it occupies." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menteri adalah buah paling kuat dalam catur, mampu bergerak sejauh apapun secara horizontal, vertikal, atau diagonal dalam garis lurus. Menteri menggabungkan pergerakan benteng dan gajah, tetapi tidak dapat melompati buah lain. Menteri memakan buah lawan dengan mendarat di kotak yang ditempatinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Rook" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benteng"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rook moves in straight lines, either horizontally along ranks or vertically along files, for any number of unoccupied squares. It cannot jump over other pieces, but it captures an enemy piece by landing on the square it occupies." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benteng bergerak lurus, baik secara horizontal di sepanjang baris maupun vertikal di sepanjang lajur, sejauh kotak kosong yang tersedia. Benteng tidak dapat melompati buah lain, namun dapat memakan buah lawan dengan mendarat di kotak yang ditempati lawan tersebut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
